<h3>Authorization</h3>
<p>
	Blnk Cloud APIs support any one of the following authentication methods. All of them work with your <code>CLOUD_API_KEY</code> or <code>OAUTH_ACCESS_TOKEN</code>.
</p>
<p>
	Pass <code>X-blnk-key: CLOUD_API_KEY</code> or <code>X-blnk-key: OAUTH_ACCESS_TOKEN</code>.
</p>
<ParamField header="X-blnk-key" type="string" required>
	Cloud API key or OAuth access token. Create credentials in <a href="/enterprise/reference/api-keys">API keys</a> or <a href="/enterprise/reference/oauth">OAuth</a>.
</ParamField>
